<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Periods and Atomic Firing Sequences of Parallel Chip-Firing Games on Directed Graphs</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">David Ji
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_email"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Email: </span><a href="mailto:david.ji@mtsdstudent.us">david.ji@mtsdstudent.us</a>
</span>
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>Montgomery High School, Skillman, 08558, New Jersey, United States of America
</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
